      "writtenOn": "2022-09-02T08:39:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m mostly following the pattern of the check_* functions above, that return a suitable Err if the thing is not allowed, and Ok(()) if all is well.\nThe messages are helpful for resolving the problem (or at least they are now, once we display them in full).\n\n(My first draft had an is_label_allowed returning bool, but that didn\u0027t work as well.)",
      "parentUuid": "5b6d8940_6d4420c2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 745,
        "startChar": 46,
        "endLine": 745,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "53cc5cac42f75422880d0a3315690a6b49cdd988",
